#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:659
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchAwayOnFieldwork"
msgid ""
"Hunh? PROF. BIRCH?\p"
"The PROF's away on fieldwork.\n"
"Ergo, he isn't here.\p"
"Oh, let me explain what fieldwork is.\p"
"It is to study things in the natural\n"
"environment, like fields and mountains,\l"
"instead of a laboratory.\p"
"The PROF isn't one for doing desk work.\n"
"He's the type of person who would\l"
"rather go outside and experience\l"
"things than read about them here.$"
msgstr ""
"嗯？小田卷博士？\p"
"博士出去做野外调查了，\n"
"所以，他现在不在这里。\p"
"啊，我来解释一下什么是野外调查吧。\p"
"就是不待在研究所里，\n"
"而是到原野、山林这些\l"
"大自然中去做研究。\p"
"博士不喜欢坐在桌子前工作。\n"
"比起在这里看书，他更喜欢\l"
"到外面去亲身体验。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:672
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchIsntOneForDeskWork"
msgid ""
"The PROF isn't one for doing desk work.\n"
"He's the type of person who would\l"
"rather go outside and experience\l"
"things than read about them here.$"
msgstr ""
"博士不喜欢坐在桌子前工作。\n"
"比起在这里看书，他更喜欢\l"
"到外面去亲身体验。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:678
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchEnjoysRivalsHelpToo"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH is studying the habitats\n"
"and distribution of POKéMON.\p"
"The PROF enjoys {RIVAL}'s help, too.\n"
"There's a lot of love there.$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士在研究宝可梦的\n"
"栖息环境和分布。\p"
"{RIVAL}来帮忙，博士也很开心。\n"
"他们的感情可好了。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:684
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_LikeYouToHavePokemon"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: So, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
"I've heard so much about you from\n"
"your father.\p"
"I've heard that you don't have your\n"
"own POKéMON yet.\p"
"But the way you battled earlier,\n"
"you pulled it off with aplomb!\p"
"I guess you have your father's blood\n"
"in your veins after all!\p"
"Oh, yes. As thanks for rescuing me,\n"
"I'd like you to have the POKéMON you\l"
"used earlier.\p"
"{PLAYER} received the {STR_VAR_1}!$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：那么，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\p"
"我从你爸爸那里\n"
"听说了很多你的事。\p"
"听说你还没有\n"
"自己的宝可梦。\p"
"可是你刚才的对战，\n"
"表现得非常沉着冷静啊！\p"
"看来你身上果然流着\n"
"你爸爸的血呢！\p"
"对了，为了感谢你救了我，\n"
"刚才你用过的那只宝可梦\l"
"就送给你吧。\p"
"{PLAYER}得到了{STR_VAR_1}！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:699
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_WhyNotGiveNicknameToMon"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: While you're at it, why not\n"
"give a nickname to that {STR_VAR_1}?$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：顺便给这只{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"取个昵称怎么样？$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:703
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MightBeGoodIdeaToGoSeeRival"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: If you work at POKéMON\n"
"and gain experience, I think you'll make\l"
"an extremely good TRAINER.\p"
"My kid, {RIVAL}, is also studying\n"
"POKéMON while helping me out.\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, don't you think it might be\n"
"a good idea to go see {RIVAL}?$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：只要你和宝可梦一起努力，\n"
"积累经验，我想你一定能成为\l"
"非常优秀的训练家。\p"
"我的孩子{RIVAL}也一边帮我的忙，\n"
"一边研究宝可梦。\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，你要不要去见见\n"
"{RIVAL}呢？$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:712
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_GetRivalToTeachYou"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: Great!\n"
"{RIVAL} should be happy, too.\p"
"Get {RIVAL} to teach you what it\n"
"means to be a TRAINER.$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：太好了！\n"
"{RIVAL}也会很高兴的。\p"
"让{RIVAL}教教你\n"
"怎样才算是训练家吧。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:718
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_DontBeThatWay"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: Oh, don't be that way.\n"
"You should go meet my kid.$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：哎呀，别这么说嘛。\n"
"你应该去见见我的孩子。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:722
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchRivalGoneHome"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: {RIVAL}?\n"
"Gone home, I think.\p"
"Or maybe that kid's scrabbling around\n"
"in tall grass again somewhere…\p"
"If you or your POKéMON get tired,\n"
"you should get some rest at home.$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：{RIVAL}？\n"
"我想应该是回家了吧。\p"
"也可能又跑到哪里的草丛里\n"
"到处转悠去了……\p"
"要是你或者你的宝可梦累了，\n"
"就回家好好休息一下吧。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:730
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_HeardYouBeatRivalTakePokedex"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: Oh, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"I heard you beat {RIVAL} on\n"
"your first try. That's excellent!\p"
"{RIVAL}'s been helping with my research\n"
"for a long time.\p"
"{RIVAL} has an extensive history as\n"
"a TRAINER already.\p"
"Here, {PLAYER}{KUN}, I ordered this for my\n"
"research, but I think you should have\l"
"this POKéDEX.$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：哦，你好，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\p"
"听说你第一次对战就赢了{RIVAL}，\n"
"真是太厉害了！\p"
"{RIVAL}帮我做研究\n"
"已经很久了。\p"
"作为训练家，{RIVAL}\n"
"也已经有很多经验了。\p"
"来，{PLAYER}{KUN}，这本宝可梦图鉴\n"
"本来是我为了研究订购的，\l"
"不过我觉得应该交给你。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:742
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_ReceivedPokedex"
msgid "{PLAYER} received the POKéDEX!$"
msgstr "{PLAYER}得到了宝可梦图鉴！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:745
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_ExplainPokedex"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: The POKéDEX is a high-tech\n"
"tool that automatically makes a record\l"
"of any POKéMON you meet or catch.\p"
"My kid, {RIVAL}, goes everywhere\n"
"with it.\p"
"Whenever my kid catches a rare POKéMON\n"
"and records its data in the POKéDEX,\l"
"why, {RIVAL} looks for me while I'm out\l"
"doing fieldwork, and shows me.$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：宝可梦图鉴是一种高科技\n"
"工具，能自动记录下你遇到过\l"
"或者捉到过的宝可梦。\p"
"我的孩子{RIVAL}不管去哪里\n"
"都带着它。\p"
"每次捉到稀有的宝可梦，\n"
"把数据记录到图鉴里以后，\l"
"{RIVAL}都会跑到我做野外调查的\l"
"地方来找我，给我看呢。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:756
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CountlessPokemonAwait"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: Countless POKéMON\n"
"await you!\p"
"Argh, I'm getting the itch to get out\n"
"and do fieldwork again!$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：无数的宝可梦\n"
"正在等着你！\p"
"啊，我又忍不住想出去\n"
"做野外调查了！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:762
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayGotPokedexTooTakeThese"
msgid ""
"MAY: Oh, wow, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"You got a POKéDEX, too!\p"
"That's great! Just like me!\n"
"I've got something for you, too!$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：哇，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"你也拿到宝可梦图鉴了！\p"
"太好了！跟我一样！\n"
"我也有东西要送给你哦！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:768
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CatchCutePokemonWithPokeBalls"
msgid ""
"MAY: It's fun if you can get a lot of\n"
"POKéMON!\p"
"I'm going to look all over the place\n"
"because I want different POKéMON.\p"
"If I find any cute POKéMON, I'll catch\n"
"them with POKé BALLS!$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：要是能收集到很多宝可梦，\n"
"一定会很开心的！\p"
"我想要各种各样的宝可梦，\n"
"所以要到处去找找看。\p"
"要是发现了可爱的宝可梦，\n"
"我就用精灵球把它们捉住！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:776
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_OhYourBagsFull"
msgid "Oh? Your BAG's full.$"
msgstr "哎呀？你的包包已经满了。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:779
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayWhereShouldIGoNext"
msgid ""
"MAY: I wonder where I should go look\n"
"for POKéMON next?$"
msgstr "小遥：下次该去哪里找宝可梦呢？$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:783
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanGotPokedexTooTakeThese"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Huh…\n"
"So you got a POKéDEX, too.\p"
"Well then, here.\n"
"I'll give you these.$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：哦……\n"
"你也拿到宝可梦图鉴了啊。\p"
"那么，给你。\n"
"这些送给你吧。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:789
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CatchCoolPokemonWithPokeBalls"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: You know it's more fun to\n"
"have a whole bunch of POKéMON.\p"
"I'm going to explore all over the place\n"
"to find different POKéMON.\p"
"If I find any cool POKéMON, you bet\n"
"I'll try to get them with POKé BALLS.$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：有很多宝可梦的话，\n"
"会更有意思哦。\p"
"我要到处去探索，\n"
"寻找各种各样的宝可梦。\p"
"要是发现了帅气的宝可梦，\n"
"我一定会用精灵球捉住它们。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:797
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_HeyYourBagsFull"
msgid "Hey, your BAG's full.$"
msgstr "喂，你的包包已经满了。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:800
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanWhereShouldIGoNext"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Where should I look for\n"
"POKéMON next…$"
msgstr "小悠：下次该去哪里找宝可梦呢……$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:804
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_SeriousLookingMachine"
msgid ""
"It's a serious-looking machine.\n"
"The PROF must use this for research.$"
msgstr ""
"这是一台看起来很专业的机器。\n"
"应该是博士做研究用的吧。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:808
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_PCUsedForResearch"
msgid ""
"It's a PC used for research.\n"
"Better not mess around with it.$"
msgstr ""
"这是研究用的电脑。\n"
"还是别乱碰比较好。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:812
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CrammedWithBooksOnPokemon"
msgid "It's crammed with books on POKéMON.$"
msgstr "里面塞满了关于宝可梦的书。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:815
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BookTooHardToRead"
msgid "It's a book that's too hard to read.$"
msgstr "这本书太难了，看不懂。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:818
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_OtherRegionsUpgradeToNational"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: Now…\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN} and {RIVAL}, I've had the two\n"
"of you help me study POKéMON.\p"
"Thanks to your help, new facts\n"
"are coming to light.\p"
"It appears that in the HOENN region,\n"
"there are also POKéMON from other\l"
"regions.\p"
"It goes to show how rich and varied\n"
"the natural environments of HOENN\l"
"happen to be.\p"
"That's why I think it's necessary for\n"
"me to upgrade your POKéDEX to\l"
"the NATIONAL Mode.\p"
"Here, let me see your POKéDEX units.$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：那么……\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}和{RIVAL}，\n"
"你们两个一直在帮我研究宝可梦。\p"
"多亏了你们的帮忙，\n"
"新的事实渐渐浮出了水面。\p"
"在丰缘地区，似乎也生活着\n"
"来自其他地区的宝可梦。\p"
"这说明丰缘地区的自然环境\n"
"是多么丰富多样。\p"
"所以，我认为有必要把\n"
"你们的宝可梦图鉴\l"
"升级成全国模式。\p"
"来，把你们的图鉴给我看看。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:835
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayUpgradeSoCool"
msgid ""
"MAY: Eheheh!\p"
"It's so cool that even my POKéDEX\n"
"is getting updated!\p"
"It's because you went out and caught\n"
"so many POKéMON, {PLAYER}{KUN}!$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：嘿嘿嘿！\p"
"连我的宝可梦图鉴也能升级，\n"
"真是太棒了！\p"
"这都是因为{PLAYER}{KUN}\n"
"去捉了那么多宝可梦哦！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:842
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanYouCanThankMe"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: I went out all over HOENN\n"
"and checked out POKéMON.\p"
"You can thank me for getting\n"
"the NATIONAL Mode POKéDEX.\p"
"Yep, you're lucky, {PLAYER}!$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：我跑遍了整个丰缘地区，\n"
"调查了很多宝可梦。\p"
"能拿到全国模式的宝可梦图鉴，\n"
"你可要谢谢我哦。\p"
"没错，你真幸运，{PLAYER}！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:849
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_OkayAllDone"
msgid "PROF. BIRCH: Okay, all done!$"
msgstr "小田卷博士：好了，大功告成！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:852
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_PokedexUpgradedToNational"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}'s POKéDEX was upgraded\n"
"to the NATIONAL Mode!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}的宝可梦图鉴\n"
"升级成了全国模式！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:856
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_GrassyPatchWaiting2"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: But listen.\n"
"You've become the CHAMPION,\l"
"but your POKéMON journey isn't over.\p"
"There is no end to the road\n"
"that is POKéMON.\p"
"Somewhere, there is a grassy patch\n"
"that's waiting for you!$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：不过，听好了。\n"
"虽然你已经成为了冠军，\l"
"但你的宝可梦之旅还没有结束。\p"
"宝可梦之路是没有尽头的。\p"
"在某个地方，\n"
"一定有一片草丛在等着你！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:865
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayTakeBreakFromFieldwork"
msgid ""
"MAY: I think I'll take a short break\n"
"from fieldwork.\p"
"I think I'll help the PROF here for\n"
"a while.$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：我想暂时休息一下，\n"
"不去做野外调查了。\p"
"我打算在这里帮博士\n"
"一段时间。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:871
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanTakeBreakFromFieldwork"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: For the time being,\n"
"I'm taking a break from fieldwork.\p"
"I'll be helping out the PROF here\n"
"for a while.$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：我暂时不去做野外调查了。\p"
"接下来一段时间，\n"
"我会在这里帮博士的忙。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:877
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CompletedDexChoosePokemon"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"Let's have a look at your POKéDEX.\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"Yes, there's no doubt about it.\p"
"You really have completed the HOENN\n"
"region's POKéDEX.\p"
"That's more than just impressive.\p"
"I have a gift for you.\p"
"Consider it my show of appreciation\n"
"for the fantastic work you've done.\p"
"My gift is a rare POKéMON only found\n"
"in another region!\p"
"You can have any one of these\n"
"three POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：哦，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"让我看看你的宝可梦图鉴吧。\p"
"…… …… ……\n"
"…… …… ……\p"
"嗯，没错。\p"
"你真的完成了\n"
"丰缘地区的宝可梦图鉴。\p"
"这简直太了不起了。\p"
"我有一份礼物要送给你。\p"
"就当作是我对你出色表现的\n"
"一点谢意吧。\p"
"我的礼物是只有在其他地区\n"
"才能找到的稀有宝可梦！\p"
"这3只宝可梦里，\n"
"你可以任选1只！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:894
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CanHaveAnyOneOfRarePokemon"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: These are rare POKéMON\n"
"only found in another region!\p"
"You can have any one of these\n"
"three POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：这些都是只有在其他地区\n"
"才能找到的稀有宝可梦！\p"
"这3只宝可梦里，\n"
"你可以任选1只！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:900
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_YoullTakeCyndaquil"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: The FIRE POKéMON\n"
"CYNDAQUIL caught your eye!\p"
"You're as sharp as ever!\p"
"So the CYNDAQUIL is your choice?$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：你看中了火属性的\n"
"宝可梦火球鼠啊！\p"
"眼光还是那么好！\p"
"那么，你要选择火球鼠吗？$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:906
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_YoullTakeTotodile"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: The WATER POKéMON\n"
"TOTODILE is your choice!\p"
"You know how to pick a good one.\p"
"So, you'll take the TOTODILE?$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：你选的是水属性的\n"
"宝可梦小锯鳄啊！\p"
"你真会挑选。\p"
"那么，你要选择小锯鳄吗？$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:912
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_YoullTakeChikorita"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: The GRASS POKéMON\n"
"CHIKORITA is your choice!\p"
"You sure know what you're doing.\p"
"So, you'll take the CHIKORITA?$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：你选的是草属性的\n"
"宝可梦菊草叶啊！\p"
"你果然很有眼光。\p"
"那么，你要选择菊草叶吗？$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:918
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_TakeYourTimeAllInvaluable"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: Take your time before\n"
"you decide.\p"
"They're all invaluable POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：慢慢考虑再决定吧。\p"
"它们都是非常珍贵的宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:924
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_PickedFinePokemon"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: I see!\n"
"You picked a fine POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：原来如此！\n"
"你选了一只很棒的宝可梦！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:928
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_ReceivedJohtoStarter"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"from PROF. BIRCH!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}从小田卷博士那里\n"
"得到了{STR_VAR_1}！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:933
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_NicknameJohtoStarter"
msgid ""
"Want to give a nickname to\n"
"the {STR_VAR_1} you received?$"
msgstr ""
"要给得到的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"取个昵称吗？$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:937
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_GrassyPatchWaiting"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: Listen, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"You've completed the HOENN POKéDEX,\l"
"but your POKéMON journey isn't over.\p"
"There is no end to the road\n"
"that is POKéMON.\p"
"Somewhere, there is a grassy patch\n"
"that's waiting for you!$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：听好了，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"虽然你完成了丰缘图鉴，\l"
"但你的宝可梦之旅还没有结束。\p"
"宝可梦之路是没有尽头的。\p"
"在某个地方，\n"
"一定有一片草丛在等着你！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:946
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BetterLeaveOthersAlone"
msgid ""
"You received the promised POKéMON.\n"
"Better leave the others alone.$"
msgstr ""
"已经得到了约定好的宝可梦。\n"
"其他的还是别动了吧。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:951
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_DontHaveAnyRoomForPokemon"
msgid ""
"Oh, you don't have any room for\n"
"this POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，你已经没有空位\n"
"放这只宝可梦了。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:955
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayWhatNextImStayingHere"
msgid ""
"MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}, after this…\n"
"What are you going to do?\p"
"Are you going to keep battling\n"
"and sharpening your skills?\p"
"Or are you going to try filling\n"
"the NATIONAL POKéDEX?\p"
"I'm staying here to help the PROF.$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：{PLAYER}{KUN}，接下来……\n"
"你打算做什么呢？\p"
"是继续对战，磨练自己的实力？\p"
"还是去努力完成\n"
"全国宝可梦图鉴？\p"
"我会留在这里帮博士的忙。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:964
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanPreferCollectingSlowly"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Rather than collecting\n"
"POKéMON, I prefer slowly and \l"
"steadily raising the one I chose.$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：比起收集宝可梦，\n"
"我更喜欢一步一个脚印地\l"
"培养自己选中的宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:969
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayHaveYouGoneToBattleFrontier"
msgid ""
"MAY: Oh, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"Have you gone to that place,\l"
"the BATTLE FRONTIER?$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：哦，你好，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"你去过那个地方了吗？\l"
"就是对战开拓区。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:974
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanHaveYouGoneToBattleFrontier"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Hey, {PLAYER}!\n"
"Have you gone out to that place,\l"
"the BATTLE FRONTIER?$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：嘿，{PLAYER}！\n"
"你去过那个地方了吗？\l"
"就是对战开拓区。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab/scripts.inc:979
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_ScottAboardSSTidalCall"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … Beep!\p"
"SCOTT: Hi, hi, {PLAYER}!\n"
"It's me, SCOTT.\p"
"I'm aboard the S.S. TIDAL now.\n"
"It feels great to be on the sea!\p"
"By the way…\p"
"There's this place that I'd like to\n"
"invite you to for a visit.\p"
"If you're interested, board a ferry\n"
"at either SLATEPORT or LILYCOVE.\p"
"I'll fill you in on the details when\n"
"we meet. I'll be waiting!\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … Click!$"
msgstr ""
"…… …… ……\n"
"…… …… 哔！\p"
"亚希达：你好你好，{PLAYER}！\n"
"是我，亚希达。\p"
"我现在在潮汐号上。\n"
"在海上的感觉真是太棒了！\p"
"对了……\p"
"有个地方，\n"
"我想邀请你去看看。\p"
"如果你有兴趣，就去凯那市\n"
"或水静市搭乘渡轮吧。\p"
"详细情况等见面的时候\n"
"再告诉你。我等着你哦！\p"
"…… …… ……\n"
"…… …… 咔嚓！$"
